<title>SINGAPORE: Noel Gifts 96 half net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Noel Gifts 96 half net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec. 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				  0.97  vs  0.61</p>
<p>    Group loss per shr (cents)	  2.16  vs  1.36</p>
<p>    Group loss fully diluted (cents)  1.66  vs  1.36</p>
<p>    Turnover				  7.16  vs  7.17</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 0.26  vs  0.07</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    0.02  vs  0.01</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)		0.41  vs  0.30</p>
<p>    Losses from associates		0.14  vs  0.03</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss			    0.86  vs  0.59</p>
<p>    Minorities				0.02  vs   nil</p>
<p>Note - Noel Gifts International Ltd is involved in the retail industry.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
